Step 4: Service layer. Changes to ReplenishService:

1. Constants: `TEMP_ESCORT_LIMIT_HOURS = 2`, `PEAK_THRESHOLD_BP = 150`.
2. createPlan: set planType=REGULAR, queuePosition=max+1.
3. approve: add executing-plan check for the ATM.
4. New: generateTemporaryPlans(ForecastGenerateRequest) — forecast + generation + conflict adjudication.
5. New: resume(planId, ResumeRequest).
6. New: dailyReconciliation(LocalDate).
7. Generalize withIdempotency with responseType.

Details for generateTemporaryPlans:

```java
@Transactional
public Outcome generateTemporaryPlans(ForecastGenerateRequest req) {
    String fingerprint = fingerprint("FORECAST_TEMP", req.requestId(), req.holidayDate().toString());
    return withIdempotency(req.requestId(), "FORECAST_TEMP", fingerprint, null, ForecastResponse.class, () -> {
        HolidayRow holiday = repo.findHolidayByDate(req.holidayDate())
            .orElseThrow(() -> new BusinessException(404, "节假日不存在于合成日历: " + req.holidayDate()));
        Instant now = Instant.now(clock);
        LocalDate today = LocalDate.ofInstant(now, ZoneOffset.UTC);
        LocalDate windowStart = holiday.holidayDate().minusDays(3);
        LocalDate windowEnd = holiday.holidayDate().minusDays(1);
        if (today.isBefore(windowStart) || today.isAfter(windowEnd)) {
            throw new BusinessException(409, "当前日期 " + today + " 不在节前 3 日窗口 " + windowStart + " ~ " + windowEnd + " 内");
        }
        List<ForecastResponse.Item> items = new ArrayList<>();
        for (Atm atm : repo.findAllAtms()) {
            items.add(generateForAtm(atm, holiday, today, now));
        }
        return Outcome.ok(new ForecastResponse(holiday.holidayDate(), holiday.name(), holiday.peakFactorBp(), windowStart, windowEnd, items));
    });
}
```

generateForAtm:
```java
private ForecastResponse.Item generateForAtm(Atm atm, HolidayRow holiday, LocalDate businessDate, Instant now) {
    long predicted = atm.dailyAvgWithdrawal() * holiday.peakFactorBp() / 100;
    long threshold = atm.dailyAvgWithdrawal() * PEAK_THRESHOLD_BP / 100;
    if (predicted <= threshold) {
        return new Item(atm.code(), predicted, threshold, false, null, null, "预测峰值未超日均 150% 阈值，不生成临时计划");
    }
    if (atm.frozen()) {
        return new Item(atm.code(), predicted, threshold, false, null, null, "该 ATM 已因押运异常冻结，不生成临时计划");
    }
    if (repo.findPlanByAtmDateAndType(atm.id(), businessDate, PlanType.TEMPORARY).isPresent()) {
        return new Item(atm.code(), predicted, threshold, false, null, null, "该 ATM 当日已存在临时计划，不重复生成");
    }
    long planned = Math.min(predicted, atm.capacity());
    // 冲突裁决：与执行中计划按金额大者优先，裁决与状态变更在同一事务内
    List<PlanRow> executing = repo.findExecutingByAtm(atm.id());
    PlanRow temp = new PlanRow();
    temp.setPlanNo("T" + ...);
    temp.setPlanType(PlanType.TEMPORARY);
    temp.setQueuePosition(repo.maxQueuePosition(atm.id()) + 1);
    temp.setBusinessDate(businessDate);
    temp.setPredictedAmount(predicted);
    temp.setPlannedAmount(planned);
    temp.setCreatedAt(now);
    if (executing.isEmpty()) {
        temp.setStatus(PlanStatus.APPROVED);
        temp.setApprovedAt(now);
        temp.setEscortDeadline(now + 2h);
        repo.insertPlan(temp);
        repo.insertFastTrackAudit(temp.getId(), "AUTO_APPROVED", "快速通道：节前峰值预测 " + predicted + " 超日均 150% 阈值 " + threshold + "，免逐级审批直接放行，押运时限 2 小时至 " + temp.getEscortDeadline(), now);
        return new Item(atm.code(), predicted, threshold, true, temp.getId(), temp.getStatus().name(), "已生成临时计划并快速放行");
    }
    PlanRow inflight = executing.get(0);
    if (planned > inflight.getPlannedAmount()) {
        // 临时计划金额大者优先：在途计划让路但保留排队位置
        PlanRow locked = lockPlan(inflight.getId());
        locked.setStatus(PlanStatus.YIELDED);
        locked.setApprovedAt(null)?  — hmm. Keep approvedAt? If yielded and resumed, resume sets new approvedAt/deadline. Keep old values; resume overwrites. Fine, don't null.
        repo.updatePlan(locked);
        repo.insertFastTrackAudit(locked.getId(), "CONFLICT_YIELD", "与临时计划冲突：金额 " + locked.getPlannedAmount() + " < " + planned + "，让路但保留排队位置 " + locked.getQueuePosition(), now);
        temp.setStatus(APPROVED); approvedAt, deadline...
        repo.insertPlan(temp);
        repo.insertFastTrackAudit(temp.getId(), "CONFLICT_WIN", ...);
        also AUTO_APPROVED audit? One audit per plan is enough; use CONFLICT_WIN for temp.
        return item generated=true status=APPROVED reason "冲突裁决：临时计划金额优先，在途计划让路";
